@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":DeleteCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "EmployeeCommandSupport" as Support LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":VersionedAddressBook" as Book MODEL_COLOR

Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Support : find(model, targetId)
Support -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Support : addressBook
Support -> Book : getEmployeeList()
Book --> Support : complete roster
Support --> Command : employeeToDelete
note over Support, Book
Lookup includes active, archived and hidden employees.
An unknown ID throws CommandException before mutation.
end note
Command -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Command : addressBook
Command -> Book : getEmployeeList()
Book --> Command : complete roster
Command -> Command : count all direct reports
Command -> Model : deleteEmployee(employeeToDelete)
Model -> Book : removeEmployee(employeeToDelete)
activate Book
note right of Book
Remove the target.
Clear every direct report's manager assignment,
including archived reports.
Keep the remaining employees' order and other fields.
end note
Book --> Model
deactivate Book
Model --> Command
note over Command, Model
The existing view predicate and sort comparator remain installed.
end note
Command --> Logic : CommandResult(details and affected-report count)
deactivate Command
note over Logic, Book
LogicManager handles checkpoint, history commit and saving.
See CommandTransaction for success and rollback paths.
end note
@enduml
